    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d546">

                <pb facs="0857" n="729" xml:id="pg729"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 546.</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Bayard</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-07-08"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 8, 1885</date>.
                        (Received July 20.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 346.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With my No. 333, of the 29th ultimo, I
                    transmitted a copy of the decision of Baron Blanc, the Italian minister, in the
                    case of the Masonic. In addition thereto the baron has given me a copy of his
                    memoir concerning the reasons for the decision rendered by the arbiter as to the
                    indemnity to be paid to the owner of the Masonic, which he has sent to his own
                    Government to support his action in case it should be called in question by
                    either of the parties interested. I have his permission to forward to you, which
                    I do herewith in translation.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JOHN W. FOSTER.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d546-a1.xml" xpointer="d546-a1"/>
            </div>
